      "writtenOn": "2014-09-09T21:15:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I meant to get back to that, these are used to order the descriptors in flash because of the sorting done by the linker script.  As such, would it be reasonable for these to just be 0x80 | TX_ENDPOINT, and RX_ENDPOINT for the one below?  I\u0027m not sure why they were magic numbers in the usb_console code.  Also, won\u0027t these be sorted based on the INTERFACE provided first?  Thanks.",
      "parentUuid": "50583741_f724aa16",
      "revId": "28bbc5942a0e5d3ac7e22b8d4bf5626d13c22cef",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
